flowchart TD

    Customer[Customer]

    Customer --> AuthPage

    AuthPage[Login / Register Page]

    %% =========================
    %% REGISTRATION FLOW
    %% =========================

    AuthPage --> Register

    Register[User Registration]

    Register --> ValidateRegistration

    ValidateRegistration[Validate Input]

    ValidateRegistration --> CreateAccount

    CreateAccount[Create User Account]

    CreateAccount --> UserDB

    UserDB[(MySQL)]

    CreateAccount --> Verification

    Verification[Email / OTP Verification]

    Verification --> AccountActivated

    AccountActivated[Account Activated]

    %% =========================
    %% LOGIN FLOW
    %% =========================

    AuthPage --> Login

    Login[User Login]

    Login --> CredentialValidation

    CredentialValidation[Validate Credentials]

    CredentialValidation --> InvalidCredentials
    CredentialValidation --> ValidCredentials

    InvalidCredentials[Login Failed]

    ValidCredentials[Credentials Verified]

    %% =========================
    %% TOKEN GENERATION
    %% =========================

    ValidCredentials --> GenerateToken

    GenerateToken[Generate Access Token]

    GenerateToken --> SessionStore

    SessionStore[(Redis Session Store)]

    GenerateToken --> Authenticated

    Authenticated[Authenticated User]

    %% =========================
    %% AUTHORIZED REQUESTS
    %% =========================

    Authenticated --> ProtectedRoute

    ProtectedRoute[Protected API Request]

    ProtectedRoute --> TokenValidation

    TokenValidation[Validate Token]

    TokenValidation --> TokenValid
    TokenValidation --> TokenExpired

    TokenValid[Access Granted]

    TokenExpired[Unauthorized]

    %% =========================
    %% ROLE BASED ACCESS
    %% =========================

    TokenValid --> RBAC

    RBAC[Role Based Access Control]

    RBAC --> CustomerRole
    RBAC --> AdminRole

    CustomerRole[Customer Permissions]
    AdminRole[Admin Permissions]

    %% =========================
    %% PASSWORD RESET
    %% =========================

    AuthPage --> ForgotPassword

    ForgotPassword[Forgot Password]

    ForgotPassword --> SendReset

    SendReset[Send Reset Link]

    SendReset --> EmailService

    EmailService[Email Service]

    EmailService --> ResetPassword

    ResetPassword[Reset Password]

    ResetPassword --> UserDB

    %% =========================
    %% LOGOUT FLOW
    %% =========================

    Authenticated --> Logout

    Logout[Logout]

    Logout --> DestroySession

    DestroySession[Invalidate Session]

    DestroySession --> SessionStore

    %% =========================
    %% MONITORING
    %% =========================

    Login --> Metrics

    InvalidCredentials --> Metrics

    TokenExpired --> Metrics

    Metrics[Authentication Metrics]

    Metrics --> Dashboard

    Dashboard[Security Dashboard]